				{
					"type": "MainSpriteFont",
					"properties": {
						"text": "[color=005D36]continued:[/color]\n\n[color=b7abbf]been to warning people of the potential for eyestrain? Seeing as it is its own category separate from, say, an epilepsy warning.[/color]\n\n[color=663E54]Wilsans:[/color]\n\n[color=b7abbf]They only hurt my eyes a teeny bit, I have a pretty good tolerance to it. When I first started I used to put spoiler/eyestrain warnings whenever I posted them, but no one has ever really said anything about it so I stopped. Of course if anyone does need me to put warnings back on them I will.\n\nI remember posting old paintings and not really having them go anywhere, but then I posted one spin piece with a lot of contrast and people loved it. So I kept going, incorporating the bright colors in most of my nopaints since.[/color]\n \n",
